{"term": {"label": "道", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "4A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/li-lou-i", "title": "離婁上", "description": "孟子曰：「離婁之明，公輸子之巧，不以規矩，不能成方員：師曠之聰，不以六律，不能正五音；堯舜之道，不以仁政，不能平治天下。今有仁心仁聞而民不被其澤，不可法於後世者，不行先王之道也。\n「故曰，徒善不足以為政，徒法不能以自行。《詩》云：『不愆不忘，率由舊章。』遵先王之法而過者，未之有也。聖人既竭目力焉，繼之以規矩準繩，以為方", "occurrences": 24, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "上", "id": "上"}, {"form": "下", "id": "下"}, {"form": "信", "id": "信"}, {"form": "先", "id": "先"}, {"form": "友", "id": "友"}, {"form": "命", "id": "命"}, {"form": "因", "id": "因"}, {"form": "天", "id": "天"}, {"form": "天下", "id": "天下"}, {"form": "師", "id": "師"}, {"form": "心", "id": "心"}, {"form": "恥", "id": "恥"}, {"form": "悅", "id": "悅"}, {"form": "援", "id": "援"}, {"form": "政", "id": "政"}, {"form": "求", "id": "求"}, {"form": "沓", "id": "沓"}, {"form": "泄", "id": "泄"}, {"form": "法", "id": "法"}, {"form": "獲", "id": "獲"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "盡", "id": "盡"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}, {"form": "親", "id": "親"}, {"form": "誠", "id": "誠"}, {"form": "道", "variants": [], "id": "道"}], "edges": [{"weight": 3.9464244321454784, "source": "沓", "target": "泄"}, {"weight": 3.5409593240373143, "source": "沓", "target": "先"}, {"weight": 3.5409593240373143, "source": "沓", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 1.5950491749820008, "source": "沓", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 1.0152306797290584, "source": "政", "target": "天下"}, {"weight": 0.7841189587656721, "source": "政", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 2.03688192726104, "source": "政", "target": "先"}, {"weight": 2.4423470353692043, "source": "政", "target": "因"}, {"weight": 2.03688192726104, "source": "政", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 2.2192034840549946, "source": "政", "target": "行"}, {"weight": 0.45561489179363596, "source": "天下", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 0.167932819341855, "source": "天下", "target": "援"}, {"weight": 1.1975522365230131, "source": "天下", "target": "悅"}, {"weight": 2.847812143477369, "source": "天", "target": "泄"}, {"weight": 2.15